      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 52 Wilford Court, Bray, Co. Wicklow to the market a magnificent three-bedroom, three-bathroom penthouse apartment ideally positioned within this modern and highly sought-after residential development. Wilford Court enjoys an enviable location, with an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and everyday amenities all within easy reach. Residents can enjoy the nearby Bray Seafront and Promenade, the scenic Bray Head walks and a host of sporting and recreational facilities. The area is exceptionally well connected with Bray DART Station, Dublin Bus and the N11/M50 road networks all easily accessible, making commuting to Dublin City Centre and beyond effortless.\n\nBright and exceptionally spacious internal living accommodation spans to impressive 163 sqm, and comprises of entrance hallway, generous open plan lounge and kitchen, three well-proportioned bedrooms including a master ensuite, a main family bathroom and guest wc. Occupying a penthouse position, the property benefits from an abundance of natural light throughout, a large balcony, and a superb layout designed for comfortable modern living.\n\nNo. 52 presents a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious penthouse apartment in one of Bray's most desirable developments. Combining generous accommodation, stylish interiors and a highly convenient location, this fantastic property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers!\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\n\nAdditional Features;\n<ul>\n <li>c. 163 sqm</li>\n <li>BER B2</li>\n <li>3 Bed / 3 Bath</li>\n <li>Management fee C. 6,252</li>\n <li>Parking</li>\n <li>Gas heating</li>\n <li>Double glazed windows</li>\n <li>Fully fitted kitchen</li>\n <li>Perfect blank canvas</li>\n <li>Large sunny private balcony</li>\n <li>Bright and airy</li>\n <li>No onwards chain</li>\n <li>Well-proportioned layout throughout</li>\n <li>Plenty of transport links nearby</li>\n <li>Wide range of local amenities within walking distance</li>\n <li>A short stroll to the beach</li>\n <li>Highly sought after location</li>\n <li>Ideal for a wide range of buyers</li>\n <li>Viewing highly advised!</li>\n</ul>\nDirections;\nEircode: A98 H728"
      },
      {
